  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia - Mekong Water Facility (Australian Water Partnership)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds the Australian Water Partnership to manage the Australia-Mekong Water Facility. This Facility supports government-to-government cooperation and provides a responsive and flexible mechanism to enhance existing water-related partnerships with governments of the region. The overall goal of the Facility is to foster rules-based governance for water, food and energy security in the Greater Mekong region.</narrative>
  </description>
